      "instance_name": "studying_boys",
      "label": "boys studying the Quran",
      "description": "A group of Rohingya refugee boys are seated on the ground, each holding an open Quran, focused on reading and studying. They are wearing traditional head coverings, and their posture indicates concentration and engagement in religious learning. The scene is arranged in a semi-circular or clustered formation, with books spread out before them.",
